    # - `Minus_CSym_Space_1_Quote_234_Quote_567_Period_89`<br>
    #   `-$ 1'234'567.89`
    # - `Minus_CSym_Space_1_Space_234_Space_567_Period_89`<br>
    #   `-$ 1 234 567.89`
    # - `CSym_Minus_1_Comma_234_Comma_567`<br>
